sectorrec (1.0-9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Use one Polkit-authenticated root broker per desktop application session.
  * Keep Cardputer passwordless helper policy and AppImage sudo unchanged.
  * Remove the former persistent per-user Polkit grants.
  * Fix release build inputs, platform-specific checks and source archives.

