sectorrec (1.0-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Avoid unexpected Polkit prompts for background SMART diagnostics.
  * Keep the GUI session when launching isolated privileged workers.
  * Allow enough time for interactive authorization during source reservation.
  * Prefer existing user device permissions before checking Polkit availability.

