sectorrec (1.0-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Use native unprivileged device reads when already permitted.
  * Desktop: authorize once with Polkit on first privileged access and
    install exact-per-user helper permissions without logout or groups.
  * Cardputer: passwordless Polkit actions limited to validated helpers.
  * Keep AppImage interactive elevation unchanged.

