sectorrec (1.0-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Unified standard Debian source package: desktop amd64/arm64 and Cardputer arm64.
  * Use distribution recovery engines and Polkit on desktop.
  * Define per-helper Polkit actions for desktop and Cardputer.
  * Offer explicit administrator enrollment for passwordless access.
  * Do not install blanket sudoers or automatic privileged grants.

